sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor C as Client
    participant FC as Portail client + Echo
    participant API as API Laravel 12
    participant AUTH as Autorisation de canal
    participant DB as MariaDB
    participant OUT as Async outbox
    participant W as Worker queue
    participant R as Reverb
    participant FS as Stockage prive
    participant FS2 as Portail staff + Echo
    actor S as Agent

    C->>FC: Ouvre le rapport du dossier
    FC->>API: POST /broadcasting/auth avec Bearer Sanctum
    API->>AUTH: ApplicationReportChannel.join
    AUTH->>DB: Verifie proprietaire ou staff + permission + agence
    API-->>FC: Autorise private-application.{id}.report

    S->>FS2: Ouvre le meme rapport autorise
    FS2->>API: POST /broadcasting/auth
    API->>AUTH: Verifie compte actif, reports.view et agence
    API-->>FS2: Autorise le canal prive

    C->>FC: Envoie un message ou une piece jointe
    FC->>API: POST /api/applications/{id}/report/messages
    opt Piece jointe
        API->>FS: MIME reel + ClamAV + chemin prive UUID
    end
    API->>DB: Transaction: report_messages + audit + outbox
    API-->>FC: 201, message durable
    OUT->>W: ProcessAsyncOutboxEventJob
    W->>DB: Charge le message apres commit
    W->>R: Evenement report.message
    R-->>FS2: Payload du message sur canal prive
    FS2-->>S: Mise a jour instantanee

    S->>FS2: Repond au client
    FS2->>API: POST /api/staff/reports/{id}/messages
    API->>DB: Message staff + audit + outbox
    API-->>FS2: 201
    OUT->>W: Reprise asynchrone et visible en cas d'echec
    W->>R: Evenement report.message
    R-->>FC: Payload temps reel
    FC-->>C: Affiche la reponse

    Note over DB,R: La persistance ne depend pas de Reverb, l'outbox permet retry et supervision.
    Note over API,R: F-002 concerne le canal notification staff partage, pas ce canal rapport branche.
